tel 1.0 propensive.dev/bolt-index

# The projects which have bolt codes: the letter and the name each is known by
# in a code, and where it keeps the record of its codes, a document of the
# schema `bolt`. A letter, once assigned, is permanent.

project a lira
  repository  https://github.com/propensive/lira
  path bolt.tel

project c consequent-style
  summary  Consequent Style, the layout standard for Scala which flare checks
  repository  https://github.com/propensive/flare
  path doc/rules/bolt.tel

project f pyrocosm
  summary  Pyrocosm, the framework of Propensive's tools, and the tools built on it: fever, flame, flare, fuel, fume and fury
  repository  https://github.com/propensive/pyrocosm
  path bolt.tel

project o orthant
  repository  https://github.com/propensive/orthant
  path bolt.tel

project p proscala
  repository  https://github.com/propensive/proscala
  path mk/bolt-codes.tel

project s soundness
  repository  https://github.com/propensive/soundness
  path doc/work/errors/bolt.tel
  note  The record is in the Orthant store of Soundness's documentation: `orthant checkout en main` writes it to this path.

project t tel
  repository  https://github.com/propensive/tel
  path spec/bolt.tel

project x xek
  repository  https://github.com/propensive/xek
  path bolt.tel
